  "verse": "Therefore it is not the truth that you can nurture thoughts and feelings at a whim, without you having to give an account for it, therefore you should consider everything if villainous thoughts and feelings proceed from you, such as in relation to killing, adultery, sexual decadence, robbery and thieving, waging battles, giving false testimony, sacrilege and slander, hatred, jealousy, revenge and retaliation as well as stinginess and many other things of a wrong sense and negative value.",
